| 1m | 3 | 5tq | 6tq | 75% |
| 500k | 7 | 5tq | 6tq | 75% |
| 250k | 14 | 5tq | 6tq | 75% |
| 125k | 28 | 5tq | 6tq | 75% |
| 100k | 35 | 5tq | 6tq | 75% | /* apb1 = 42mhz，统一用 bs1=5tq + bs2=6tq（共 12tq，采样点 75%）
